draftside-companion (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ask for the private dashboard URL on first launch instead of embedding it.
  * Require existing installations to confirm their dashboard URL after upgrade.
  * Fix Chrome startup under the systemd user service.
  * Open links with the desktop handler and start Chrome at ESPN's current fantasy home.
  * Show each connection stage and write redacted status transitions to the journal.
  * Refresh once to synchronize, never on retries, and report delivery validation failures.

